Prevalence.; Praevalentia.
See <Mighty-Validus>.

@AC 3295. "People shall prevail over people" (Genesis 25:23). To "prevail over" = to be higher.

@3415. "Thou prevailest exceedingly over us" (Genesis 26:16) = on account of the Divine in them.

@3927. "I have prevailed" (Genesis 30:8) = to overcome.

@4276. "He did not prevail -praevalere- over him" (Genesis 32:25) = that he overcame in temptations.

