@263[end]. They sink down into a certain prison...

@268[end]. They are thrust naked into some infernal prison, where they are made to labour for clothing and food, and then for a few coins...

@TCR 79[end]. They asked those in the same prison whether they were so to live to eternity; and some there replied, We have been here for some ages, and shall remain for ages of ages; because the nature we contracted in the world cannot be changed... by penalties...

@SE 4652. He marked the starting-place... When they return to the first starting-place.

@4921[end]. Those in like evil are in a like chamber, and are there detained in prison...

@DMin 4585. All who are kept bound by evil are "in prison;" as they know...

@AE 122. Those in the spiritual affection of truth... are detained in such a prison whenever they do not understand the Word, and yet Want to understand it. (Explained.)

@239[8]. That they are to be brought out of ignorance and falsities, is signified by to "lead the bound out of the prison" (Isaiah 42:7).

@811[12]. Jeremiah "delivered into the prison" (Jeremiah 20:1-6; 27.) represented that the like would be done with the Church and its doctrine, which is signified by the whole of Judah being carried away into the Babylonish captivity.

@1015[end]. By "the prison" (Matthew 5:25) is meant Hell.

@LJPost 227. In such a prison are kept all, both men and women, who have lived evilly; that is, have given the reins to sins; and, before they come there, everything which they had learned from the Word is taken away from them... and also the Knowledge of whom they had been in the world...

