@8902[14]. "Prophets and apostles" (Luke 11:49) = the truths and goods of the Church.

@9188[8]. That "prophet" (Deuteronomy 18:15) is the Lord. Illustrated.

@--[end]. A "prophet" = one who teaches; in the abstract sense, doctrine; thus the Lord as to the Word or Divine truth.

