@157. As in a state of the mind separated from the body, the prophets saw such things as come forth in the Spiritual World, it is called "a vision of God"... This is the state in which I have been for twenty-six years, with the difference that I have been in the spirit and body at the same time, and only sometimes out of the body. Illustrated.

