@9049[6]. The reason evil is not to be "resisted," is that evil hurts not those who are in truth and good; for they are safe by the Lord.

@9108. The Spirits of Saturn feared nothing, because they were safe.

@9141[4]. Truths of doctrine from the Word, through which there is protection from the falsities of evil. Signified.

@9278[3]. The Hells continually endeavour to infest... but the Lord continually protects...

@9316. When the Lord has protected against the evils and falsities which infest the Church. Signified.

@--[end]. By the mere protection of Heaven by the Lord, Hell is removed; that is, by the mere protection of those who are in good and truth, those in evil and falsity are removed.

@9324. Protection from falsifications of truth and adulterations of good. Signified.

@9492[2]. The good proceeding from the Lord... protects them. Signified.

@9629. The manner in which this ultimate proceeds from good, so as to render Heaven safe. Signified, Explained.

